<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 19.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 19.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   McIntosh Sec	    11.25   0.80</p>
<p> 2   Prime Credit Tr	 10.43   0.94</p>
<p> 3   Villa World	     10.28   1.07</p>
<p> 4   Indu Property	   10.11   0.90</p>
<p> 5   BT Prop Trust	   10.01   1.63</p>
<p> 6   Prop Income Inv	  9.82   1.04</p>
<p> 7   Colonial Mutual	  9.71   1.09</p>
<p> 8   Central Equity	   9.57   0.94</p>
<p> 9   Gandel Retail Tr	 9.07   0.86</p>
<p>10   Centro Prop		9.07   2.15</p>
<p>11   Barclays Mirvac	  8.80   1.25</p>
<p>12   Nth Building Soc	 8.75   2.63</p>
<p>13   Gen Prop Tr		8.74   2.30</p>
<p>14   Aust Tour		  8.72   0.86</p>
